{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S05、S13等段落，未标注时点的感受短词仍然偏密，快速扫读不如X左右分栏来得直接。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】把每段真正重要的心理变化凸显出来，又通过分时出现的感受词把音乐细节和人物情绪对应起来，观众更容易抓住从害怕给对方负担、逐渐相信彼此、害怕失去，到最终接受不确定性的完整变化。尤其在动机和细腻程度上，Y比X多呈现了几层心理矛盾，也更能让人感到音乐里的具体起伏，而不只是听到笼统的欢喜、难过和舍不得。X的优势是左右分栏清楚、叙述流畅，但部分心理转折和音乐细节被简化了。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2a0d068e-72da-4695-8746-27d8a5981920", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T045225740059Z", "elapsed_seconds": 92.657, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:53:58.405731+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "55c5e719d06b761d4d93c34ec40a39b3ec7529fd479b5e6833d5bf5b91aeb0be", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_a